{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"It is almost the meridian hour, and the plan, which posited a walk to the IIC at 10:15, has been evidently overlooked within the fog of the morning. The body is hollowed out, and the head is filled with abstract delays. I must move, if only to force the day into a shape that is not merely the waiting for orders that will not come. The heat is mild, a rare mercy, and the air, though polluted, is clear."}}],"created":1795128996,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":102,"prompt_tokens":162,"total_tokens":264,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-nlmM7EbBWObxJ971qrlKviL41E6R1SKa","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":162,"prompt_ms":487.781,"prompt_per_token_ms":3.010993827160494,"prompt_per_second":332.1162570907846,"predicted_n":102,"predicted_ms":2480.997,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.564326732673265,"predicted_per_second":40.70944059988787}}